## Dataset format

This dataset is distributed in [YOLO](https://docs.ultralytics.com/datasets/) training format:
image files split into `train`/`val`/`test` sets, described by a `data.yaml` config.

{% if class_names %}
It has {{ num_classes }} class{{ "es" if num_classes != 1 else "" }}: {{ class_names | join(", ") }}.
{% endif %}

{% if mirror_images %}
```text
.
├── data.yaml             ← YOLO dataset config (splits, classes)
├── images/
│   ├── train/            ← training images
│   ├── val/               ← validation images
│   └── test/              ← test images (if present)
├── labels/                ← training labels (if present in the source dataset)
│   ├── train/
│   ├── val/
│   └── test/
├── yolo-local.zip         ← same dataset (data.yaml + images/ + labels/), bundled
├── checksums-sha256.txt
├── CITATION.cff
└── LICENSE
```

`yolo-local.zip` bundles everything above (except this README/checksums/citation/license)
into a single archive, for local use without depending on the folder structure.
{% else %}
